msgstr "Forward incoming call alerts"

msgid "默认关闭。两个槽位的来电按当前配置模式转发，包含卡源和来电号码；每通电话只提醒一次。"
msgstr "Off by default. Calls on both slots use the selected forwarding mode, including the SIM source and caller number. One alert per call."

msgid "eSIM 管理"
msgstr "eSIM management"

# SMS regular expression filters
msgid "正则筛选（可选）"
msgstr "Regular expression filters (optional)"

msgid "号码和正文的筛选须同时通过。仅影响新收到的短信，不影响电源或来电通知。"
msgstr "Both number and message filters must pass. Applies only to new incoming SMS, not power or incoming-call alerts."

msgid "号码筛选"
msgstr "Number filter"

msgid "正文筛选"
msgstr "Message filter"

msgid "关闭筛选"
msgstr "Filter off"

msgid "黑名单：匹配则不转发"
msgstr "Blocklist: do not forward matches"

msgid "白名单：仅匹配才转发"
msgstr "Allowlist: forward matches only"

msgid "号码正则 · 每行一条"
msgstr "Number expressions · one per line"

msgid "正文正则 · 每行一条"
msgstr "Message expressions · one per line"

msgid "忽略英文字母大小写"
msgstr "Ignore letter case"

msgid "每项最多 32 条，每条最多 512 字节。同项内任一行匹配即命中；白名单至少填写一条。"
msgstr "Up to 32 expressions per field, 512 bytes each. Any matching line counts; an allowlist needs at least one expression."

msgid "使用 POSIX 扩展正则，不加 / 分隔符；数字用 [0-9]。匹配原始号码（包含 +）和完整正文，点号可跨行。"
msgstr "Use POSIX extended expressions without / delimiters; use [0-9] for digits. Matches the original number (including +) and full message; dot can cross line breaks."

msgid "号码正则表达式无效"
msgstr "Invalid number expression"

msgid "正文正则表达式无效"
msgstr "Invalid message expression"

msgid "号码白名单至少填写一条正则"
msgstr "The number allowlist needs at least one expression"

msgid "正文白名单至少填写一条正则"
msgstr "The message allowlist needs at least one expression"

msgid "短信筛选规则无效"
msgstr "Invalid SMS filter rules"

msgid "正则条数或长度超过上限"
msgstr "Too many expressions or an expression is too long"

msgid "第 %d 行"
msgstr "Line %d"

msgid "旧版号码与关键词黑名单已停用；如需继续拦截，请在下方正则筛选中设置。"
msgstr "Legacy number and keyword blocklists are inactive. Set the regex filters below to continue blocking."
